ort-csv","Drag out a table or export CSV",{"id":90,"text":91},"copy-a-range-for-another-app","Copy a range for another app",{"id":93,"text":94},"workbooks-and-sheet-archive","Workbooks and sheet archive",{"id":96,"text":97},"tsv-and-excel-files","TSV and Excel files",{"id":99,"text":100},"preview-paste-and-fill","Preview paste and fill",{"id":102,"text":103},"format-a-range","Format a range",{"id":105,"text":106},"calculate-and-copy","Calculate and copy",{"id":108,"text":109},"work-across-sheets","Work across sheets",{"id":111,"text":112},"check-inputs-as-you-edit","Check inputs as you edit",{"title":114,"path":115,"headings":116},"Capture and paste","/docs/capture",[117,120,123,126],{"id":118,"text":119},"capture-amounts","Capture amounts",{"id":121,"text":122},"read-a-screenshot","Read a screenshot",{"id":124,"text":125},"choose-how-to-paste","Choose how to paste",{"id":127,"text":128},"fill-a-series","Fill a series",{"title":130,"path":131,"headings":132},"Notes and Obsidian","/docs/notes-and-obsidian",[133,136,139,142,145,148,151,154,157,160,163],{"id":134,"text":135},"move-notes","Move Notes",{"id":137,"text":138},"resize-notes","Resize Notes",{"id":140,"text":141},"format-a-note","Format a note",{"id":143,"text":144},"annotate-a-cell-or-range","Annotate a cell or range",{"id":146,"text":147},"put-a-live-result-in-a-note","Put a live result in a note",{"id":149,"text":150},"repair-a-note-link","Repair a note link",{"id":152,"text":153},"send-the-table-and-notes","Send the table and notes",{"id":155,"text":156},"save-a-dated-sheet-note","Save a dated sheet note",{"id":158,"text":159},"edit-a-table-in-both-scratch-and-obsidian","Edit a table in both Scratch and Obsidian",{"id":161,"text":162},"open-an-export-in-scratch","Open an export in Scratch",{"id":164,"text":165},"search-your-obsidian-vault","Search your Obsidian vault",{"title":167,"path":168,"headings":169},"Formula Microscope","/docs/formula-microscope",[170,173,176,179],{"id":171,"text":172},"read-a-calculation","Read a calculation",{"id":174,"text":175},"find-a-cell-behind-an-error","Find a cell behind an error",{"id":177,"text":178},"match-formula-references-to-the-grid","Match formula references to the grid",{"id":180,"text":181},"see-where-a-pinned-result-came-from","See where a pinned result came from",{"title":183,"path":184,"headings":185},"Selection History","/docs/history",[186,189],{"id":187,"text":188},"compare-a-revision","Compare a revision",{"id":190,"text":191},"restore-just-the-range","Restore just the range",{"title":193,"path":194,"headings":195},"Record and Replay","/docs/replay",[196],{"id":197,"text":198},"try-it-on-another-range","Try it on another range"],"uses":{}},{"type":"data","data":[{"doc":1,"prev":7,"next":10},{"title":2,"description":3,"html":4,"path":5,"group":6},"Selection History","Compare earlier cell entries and recover a range without rolling back the sheet.","\u003Cp class=\"lead\">Select the cells you want to recover and choose Show Selection History from the sheet menu or the command palette.\u003C/p>\n\u003Ch2 id=\"compare-a-revision\">Compare a revision\u003Ca class=\"anchor\" href=\"#compare-a-revision\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\">\u003Csvg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u003Cpath d=\"M6.5 9.5a2.8 2.8 0 0 0 4 0l2.2-2.2a2.8 2.8 0 0 0-4-4l-.7.7\"/>\u003Cpath d=\"M9.5 6.5a2.8 2.8 0 0 0-4 0L3.3 8.7a2.8 2.8 0 0 0 4 4l.7-.7\"/>\u003C/svg>\u003C/a>\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cp>Pick a revision to see the selected cells that differ from the current sheet. \u003Cstrong>Before\u003C/strong> shows the entries and formatting just before that edit. \u003Cstrong>Now\u003C/strong> shows what is in the grid. Changed entries or formats are emphasised. Formula cells show the expression that will be restored. Hover over the revision time for the exact date and time.\u003C/p>\n\u003Cfigure class=\"scratch-media\">\n\u003Cimg class=\"scratch-light\" src=\"/docs/history-revision-light.webp\" alt=\"Selection History compares the previous and current venue and catering amounts.\" width=\"944\" height=\"496\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n\u003Cimg class=\"scratch-dark\" src=\"/docs/history-revision-dark.webp\" alt=\"Selection History compares the previous and current venue and catering amounts.\" width=\"944\" height=\"496\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n\u003C/figure>\u003Ch2 id=\"restore-just-the-range\">Restore just the range\u003Ca class=\"anchor\" href=\"#restore-just-the-range\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\">\u003Csvg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u003Cpath d=\"M6.5 9.5a2.8 2.8 0 0 0 4 0l2.2-2.2a2.8 2.8 0 0 0-4-4l-.7.7\"/>\u003Cpath d=\"M9.5 6.5a2.8 2.8 0 0 0-4 0L3.3 8.7a2.8 2.8 0 0 0 4 4l.7-.7\"/>\u003C/svg>\u003C/a>\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cp>Enter \u003Ccode>10\u003C/code> in A1 and \u003Ccode>=A1*2\u003C/code> in B1. Change A1 to \u003Ccode>15\u003C/code>, then select A1:B1 and open \u003Cstrong>Show Selection History\u003C/strong>. Choose the revision before the last edit and click \u003Cstrong>Restore A1:B1\u003C/strong>. A1 returns to \u003Ccode>10\u003C/code> and B1 recalculates to \u003Ccode>20\u003C/code>.\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>Scratch restores entries and formatting inside the selected range. Cells outside it keep their current entries. Formulas recalculate using the current sheet, including any references outside the range. Press ⌘Z to reverse the restore in one step.\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>History starts with edits made after installing this build and stays in the workbook on your Mac across launches. Scratch keeps up to 100 recent grid edits per sheet. Large edits can reduce how many older revisions are kept.\u003C/p>\n","/docs/history","Guides",{"title":8,"path":9},"Formula Microscope","/docs/formula-microscope",{"title":11,"path":12},"Record and Replay","/docs/replay"],"uses":{"params":["page"]}}]}
